0..78 Comment "// A method that answers a place. A method whose receiver\'s mode is a variable"
79..157 Comment "// of its implicit block, `self : m T` under `@[m : Mode]`, answers a place of"
158..235 Comment "// its receiver at that mode, `View[m](a)`, its returner the one the lowering"
236..315 Comment "// inserts at a result (#2255): its body is the place, `self[i]`, and a call is"
316..394 Comment "// the access to it. A call with a block, `xs.first() as w { … }`, lends the"
395..475 Comment "// place at the mode the block asks — a resume or an abort through `w` asks an"
476..557 Comment "// exclusive lend, a read alone a shared one — and a call without one reads the"
558..635 Comment "// place. One body serves every mode, as an explicit object parameter deduces"
636..715 Comment "// its receiver\'s qualifiers (Ažman, Brand, Deane and Revzin, \"Deducing this\","
716..747 Comment "// C++ proposal P0847R7, 2021)."
749..783 Comment "// The list each call below holds."
